  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:221a64de406d76d38b8c7a54f96579c8de9aafe31e4b1cbcd3dfe2f1ccf3d2bb",
      "text": "青春校园电影的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d9ca1799c130542cbbc3997db0d4240b33b4a76512c8cc77a244300508a692",
      "text": "唔——……在背后推主角一把的冷酷前辈吗？\n总觉得很难把握这个角色啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fbae5e75a7f3093a8d7e19285c4d98abb9132722a9543e87038f65baa88ecc3",
      "text": "遇到什么烦恼了吗？\n如果可以的话，不妨跟我商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb3b5a6703573d44ad64041cefe1e0704fce6acc5219aaa61e88575edbd2a976",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！其实是那个冷酷的前辈角色，我怎么都没法找到具体的感觉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14881b4cedfb31553d9d4eb8f07c0b93196acfc42dd886f7370f8ddf0c3b06b5",
      "text": "这样啊……那从身边的人身上\n试着找找感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2b8f4f47e94f67b92370137f8013a1dc10865c8aacc9220ef7c616022c2fde8",
      "text": "哦哦，这是个好主意！我身边那种\n既冷酷又帅气，而且还很温柔的人啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d08824428f539fe0593f1f6f26cd31e502fa80e6c56330cb867d8613b7582a0",
      "text": "“我眼神凶恶是天生的。\n吓到你真是不好意思啊……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32a95b9652e5921b219cd2d1dabe33a68ab8b61c1a65274f3debbf0cb6e57ab9",
      "text": "这难道是……在模仿英雄先生吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ecd349b61e524667c19ec62f45efbcb6bda96f44c3a2ecc6fd96bd1b70d525e",
      "text": "没错！说到既冷酷又能在背后推人一把的前辈，\n我一下子就想到英雄先生了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f431f6da1ec7fea4a3ff3f3d82d53a0b36ce48d95cf432406af05898add1126f",
      "text": "确实，感觉非常贴切呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d51d61f5ff682ab97cddbd3615e2b8ed06cc4d2d802787e89ac842cd1f670a1",
      "text": "好——嘞！我要以英雄先生为参考，\n好好练习演出那种冷酷感——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
